		{"id":"b94e356557891166","type":"text","text":"The Syndicate\n- legal company preserving artifacts on the outside\n- smuggling and hoarding vast amount of magical artifacts and technology","x":-2827,"y":723,"width":445,"height":200,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"dd4db6c44fc67d1a","type":"text","text":"The Inverted University\n- conducts illegal research activities\n- forbidden rituals, necromancy, blood magic...\n- offers experimentational surgeries and remedies\n- biotech, body alterations","x":165,"y":731,"width":455,"height":180,"color":"1"},
