		{"id":"090ada6be8c62c08","type":"text","text":"The Eternal Court\n- mage court\n- criminal elite\n- trafficing, theft, gambling, prostitution\n- supporting revolution","x":-660,"y":719,"width":332,"height":221,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"6e49390ac072e8dc","type":"text","text":"Shadow Broker\n- surveillance using small beasts, mechanisms or arcane\n- trades with information\n- the Shadow Broker is more of a title than an individual","x":-2300,"y":1055,"width":360,"height":223,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"8ae622170b4773f0","type":"text","text":"Red Sigil\n- activists\n- overthrowing the government\n- convinced the government is hiding something","x":-1764,"y":1072,"width":302,"height":190,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"51d2a9b9a3b2d63a","type":"text","text":"Undertakers\n- bounty hunters for hire\n- most brutal jobs\n- assassinations\n- necromancy ressurection for hire\n- torture","x":-1280,"y":1060,"width":340,"height":214,"color":"1"},
