		{"id":"158a16a8d4ba88ed","type":"text","text":"Revolutionary leader\n- leader of the moderate revolutionary wing\n- has a secret private army\n- large wealth in some large city","x":-260,"y":-660,"width":445,"height":160,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"f437672434ab0108","type":"text","text":"The Dusk Exchange\n- black market of technology, artifacts, goods\n- you can even buy patents or inventions here\n- hidden by illusion magic, can't find it unless you know how","x":-2788,"y":1100,"width":367,"height":235,"color":"1"},
